      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we actually want to pull in the entire namespace? I\u0027ve been under the impression that it\u0027s better to just pull in the symbols you need individually (`using skia_private::TArray;`) and, FWIW, that\u0027s the law of the land in google3. We might need a template decoration but that\u0027s NBD.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
