      "writtenOn": "2023-02-27T19:21:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I actually asked this question when Mike \u0026 Mike were still around. T in the name is the Skia traditional marking a utility class that could vary by type. The S indicates a portion of the item could be on the \"Stack\". What it really means is that a portion could be inlined.",
      "parentUuid": "45f99fee_4f73c9d0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
